[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（２８３プロダクションに入社して数か月……\r\nいよいよ俺が、アイドルをプロデュースする時が来た）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "001"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ずっと憧れていた仕事をようやく任されたんだ、\r\nこれから精一杯頑張るぞ！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはようございます！\r\nって、天井社長……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010010,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "おはよう、お前を待っていたぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1902001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（この２８３プロダクションを束ねる\r\n天井社長……あいかわらずダンディな雰囲気だ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010020,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "お前には今日から、アイドルを\r\nプロデュースしてもらうと伝えていたが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1902001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010030,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "素晴らしい結果を期待させてもらう\r\n私は甘くないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1902001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "は、はい！　よろしくお願いします！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010040,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "よろしい。では、仕事の説明ははづきに任せて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1902001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？　はづきさんはどこにも……あっ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そ、ソファの裏で誰かが倒れてる！？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "……ふわぁ～？\r\nなんですか～急に大きな声出して～……",
    "charAnim1": "sleep1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charType": "sub_characters",
    "charId": "staff",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1901001010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010050,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "は、はづき……なぜ床で寝ているんだ",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1902001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "すみません、ソファへ着く前に\r\n眠気に負けてしまいまして～……",
    "charAnim1": "sleep2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1901001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010060,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "せっかくまじめな雰囲気を出したというのに……",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1902001010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010070,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……ともかく！\r\n彼に仕事の説明をしてくれ",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1902001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010030,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい、もちろんです\r\nプロデューサーさん、どうぞ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1901001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\n……あいかわらず、わかりやすくまとまってますね、資料",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（はづきさん、こういうところは頼れるんだよな……）",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010040,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\nそれじゃあ、さっそくお仕事の説明に入りますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1901001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010050,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "まず、今回のプロデュースの目標についてですが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1901001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010060,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ワンダーアイドルノヴァ・グランプリ……\r\n通称『W.I.N.G.』への出場を目指してください",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1901001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』……ですか",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010070,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい\r\n新人アイドルの祭典とも言われる、すごいライブなんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1901001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010080,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "祭典と言われるだけあって、この『W.I.N.G.』は\r\n出場資格を手に入れるまでが厳しいんです……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1901001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010090,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "エントリーしたアイドルは開催前まで、\r\n全４回のシーズンごとに審査を受けます",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1901001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010100,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "その時、一定のランクに達していないと、\r\n出場資格を失ってしまうんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1901001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010110,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ですので、精一杯頑張っていきましょ～！\r\n私もたくさんサポートさせていただきますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1901001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010080,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……少しアドバイスをしておくが、\r\nお前は、２８３プロダクションのプロデューサーだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1902001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010090,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "担当アイドルと他のアイドルたちを\r\n交流させることも重要になってくる",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1902001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010100,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "互いに影響しあうことで目指せる高みもあるだろう",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1902001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010110,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "まあ、まずは思うようにやってみるといい\r\n結果がついてくるかは、お前とアイドルの頑張り次第だ",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1902001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010120,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "では、そろそろお仕事に移ってもらいましょうか\r\n今回プロデュースするアイドルは──",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1901001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010210,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんが書類で合格を出した子ですけど……\r\n今の時間は、ダンスレッスン場にいるみたいですよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1901001010210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうですか\r\nじゃあ、会いに行ってきます",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00014",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000,
    "bgEffect": "mask"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……有栖川夏葉さん、か。いいところの\r\nお嬢様みたいだけど、いったいどんな子だろう……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0121"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001010010,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー！",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0121",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1013001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "013",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500,
    "charCategory": "stand_jersey"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……すごい熱気だな\r\n邪魔するのも良くないし、このまま待っていよう）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black2",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 240
    }
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black2",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 240
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001010020,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "アナタが私のプロデューサーね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1013001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、君が有――",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001010030,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "いい？　目指すならトップだけよ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1013001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……え、えーっと？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001010040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "あら、何を呆けているのかしら\r\n当然のことでしょう！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1013001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001010050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "アイドルだろうとなんだろうと、\r\n世界一以外の目標はありえないわ！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1013001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001010060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "アナタも私のプロデューサーなら\r\nそのつもりでいなさい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1013001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……わかった。じゃあ、そのために\r\nどうすればいいか、一緒に考えていこう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001010070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "いいえ、その必要はないわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1013001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どういうことだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001010080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "アイドルのプロデュースならアナタのほうが\r\n経験があるかもしれないけど",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1013001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001010090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "有栖川夏葉のプロデュースなら私のほうが\r\n経験が長いというだけの話よ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1013001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001010100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "だからアナタは何も考えなくていいの\r\n全部私に任せておきなさい",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1013001010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん……さすがにそういうわけにもいかないけど、\r\n君の意見はできるだけ取り入れていくことにしよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それと、君には『放課後クライマックスガールズ』という\r\n五人組ユニットで活動してもらうことになっているが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001010110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "別にいいわよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1013001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001010120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ソロだろうとユニットだろうと、\r\n私がトップを目指すことには変わりないもの",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1013001010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\nじゃあ、これからよろしく頼むよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001010130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ\r\nしっかり私についてきなさい、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300101/1013001010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……清楚なお嬢様を想像してたけど、\r\nかなり芯の強い女の子なんだな）",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、この個性をなるべく活かしていけるよう\r\n頑張ってプロデュースしていこう）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]